## Tech Stack

| Component | Technology | Cost |
|---|---|---|
| LLM | Groq — Llama 3.3 70B Versatile | Free tier |
| Web Search | DuckDuckGo Search | Free — no key required |
| Orchestration | LangGraph | Free — open source |
| LLM Framework | LangChain | Free — open source |
| Monitoring | LangSmith | Free tier — 5,000 traces/month |
| Interface | Streamlit | Free — open source |
| Hosting | Streamlit Community Cloud | Free |
| Development | Google Colab | Free |
| Version Control | GitHub | Free |

**Total infrastructure cost: $0**

